// ── SPAN SEGMENTS *(v220)* ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
// A span is ONE record but potentially MANY drawn bars: the month grid is a 7-column
// layout, so a span crossing a Sunday cannot be a single box. This cuts each span into
// one segment per week row and assigns each a LANE so overlapping spans never draw on
// top of one another.
//
// Inputs are occurrence-level (already materialised), so a per-occurrence `spanDays`
// override in exceptions is respected automatically.
